00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:31.270
So we took some time to actually
decide what you want to do.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:34.360
And then, whatever you pick,
we give you-- in Cloud Sprint,

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:38.710
